  "description_text": "This sun-drenched, two-level condo built in 2019 offers a flawlessly modern lifestyle where everything still feels essentially new. Boasting an abundance of natural light and soaring skylights, the home features beautiful hardwood floors and a fabulous open layout that seamlessly connects the living, dining, and entertaining spaces. The sleek kitchen comes fully equipped with premium stainless steel appliances, situated just steps from a pristine full bath. Upstairs, the spacious primary bedroom serves as a private retreat, enjoying soaring ceilings and a luxurious ensuite bath complete with a dual-sink vanity. Complete with two comfortable bedrooms, two full bathrooms, the ultimate convenience of in-unit laundry, and a coveted one-car attached garage parking spot, this residence hits every item on your wish list. Best of all, its prime location is just moments from the Andrew Red Line T stop, only two quick stops from South Station to instantly open up the very best dining, shopping, and entertainment that Boston has to offer.",
